  "description": "QRCoder is a simple library, written in C#.NET, which enables you to create QR codes. This fork renders using Magick.NET instead of System.Drawing, so raster renderers work cross-platform. The assembly and namespace remain 'QRCoder'.",
  "iconFile": "nuget-icon.png",
